      "title": "catapult_dct2000: consistently do \"is this a comment?\" tests.",
      "message": "catapult_dct2000: consistently do \"is this a comment?\" tests.\n\nIf we have both \"this is a comemnt\" and \"this is not a comment\"\nbranches, do them all as\n\n\tif (this is a comment) {\n\t\tdo comment stuff;\n\t} else {\n\t\tdo non-comment stuff;\n\t}\n\nrather than the other way around. They were mixed before, which made the\ncode a little bit confusing.\n",
